Your AC is great, past about -30 it's hardly worth improving (really,
-25 is fine without any special tricks).

Air elementals, though, ignore AC for damage.  -100 wouldn't help.

As a valk you'll have the Orb in main inventory so that halves damage
from them

In order:
1. Be very fast and cause conflict.  This helps avoid them
2. Zap /teleport if 2 or more are lined up approaching you.
3. Zap /polymorph if engulfed.
4. Zap w/ wands of slow monster (unengulfs you and slows them down for
the future)
5. Zap w/ wands of teleport or death if engulfed (this is last to save
those valuable charges; if you've got tons extra use earlier).
6. Have !full healing in main inventory.


